[speed=0.7]...Huh?[/speed]

[speed=0.6]Oww... everything hurts...[/speed]

[speed=0.9][wave amp=1 freq=2]...The water![/wave][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8]Nanay?[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8]Tatay?[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.9]Kuya Dodong? Noni? Ate Valerie? Kiki?[/speed]

[speed=0.6]Where is everyone?[/speed]

[speed=0.7]...[/speed]

PILI: [speed=1.0][b]Oh, anak! You're awake![/b][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=1.2][shake rate=16 level=7][b]NANAY![/b][/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.6][shake rate=10 level=5]I... I was so scared![/shake][/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.7]Shhh... I'm here, anak. I'm right here.[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.6][shake rate=8 level=4]I thought... I thought I couldn't find you anymore...[/shake][/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.8]It's okay. You're safe now.[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8]Where's everyone else?[/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.9]They're here, anak.[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.7]...Really?[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.7]...What about Kuya Dodong?[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.6][shake rate=7 level=3]Nanay?[/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.7][shake rate=9 level=4]Where's Kuya?[/shake][/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.6]We're still looking for him, anak...[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.7]...Still looking?[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=1.0][shake rate=12 level=6]Maybe he's over there![/shake][/speed]

PILI: [speed=1.0][b]Ollie, careful! You need to rest first![/b][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=1.1][shake rate=16 level=8][b]But I have to find him![/b][/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=1.0][shake rate=14 level=7][b]Noni was right there! I was holding on to him![/b][/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8][shake rate=20 level=8][b]I tried to grab him, Nanay! I really tried![/b][/shake][/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.6]Oh, anak...[/speed]

[speed=0.7][shake rate=10 level=5]The water took him away...[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=9 level=4]I couldn't reach him...[/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8][shake rate=25 level=8][b]I'm sorry, Nay! I-I'm so sorry... I...[/b][/shake][/speed]

PILI: [speed=0.8]It's not your fault, Ollie. You hear me? It's not your fault.[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.7][shake rate=8 level=4]But I was right there![/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.6][shake rate=9 level=4]I was supposed to help him... I was so close...[/shake][/speed]

VALERIE: [speed=0.7]Ollie...[/speed]

KIKI: [speed=0.7]Uya![/speed]

NONI: [speed=0.6][shake rate=3 level=3]Kuya...[/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8][shake rate=8 level=4]Ate...Kiki...Noni...[/shake][/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=0.7]Ollie, anak...[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8][shake rate=25 level=8]Tatay...[/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8][shake rate=12 level=6]Tatay! You're here![/shake][/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=0.8]I'm here, anak. I'm here.[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.7]I thought the water took you too...[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8]But... Kuya...[/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=0.7]I know, anak... We're still looking for him.[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.6]...He was right there.[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.6]He was trying to hold on to me...[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.6][shake rate=10 level=5]I should've held him too...[/shake][/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=0.8]No, anak. Don't blame yourself.[/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=0.7]You did everything you could.[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.6][shake rate=15 level=6]But I couldn't save him...[/shake][/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=0.7]We'll keep looking for your brother. We won't stop.[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.7]...Promise?[/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=0.8]I promise, anak.[/speed]

Tatay's here...

Nanay's here...

Everyone's here except...

[speed=0.6][shake rate=5 level=3]Kuya...[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.6]Maybe he's just lost...Maybe someone found him...[/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=5 level=3]Kuya... We're here...[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.5][shake rate=6 level=3]Please come back...[/shake][/speed]

